    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/ed6b2e88e9cdbf69b41a1a77de7e5943.poster.avif?t=1753562262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/ed6b2e88e9cdbf69b41a1a77de7e5943.webm?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Controller</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Pure Keyboard</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Keys of Fury</i> is a retro style <i>Beat `em up</i> typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy loads of enemies as you type your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn coins for each perfect word typed and use them to purchase abilities, outfits, accessories, and music tracks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.poster.avif?t=1753562262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.webm?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.mp4?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade</strong>:\u00a0 A Potpourri of a variety of levels including Bad Dad Jokes, Racing Dinosaurs, and battling through waves of increasingly difficultly worded enemies.\u00a0 Choose upgrades between each wave to prepare for the next one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong>:\u00a0 Help clear corruption from the inner city and engage in your own witty banter with the locals.\u00a0 Fight a variety of enemies: robots, ninjas, vegetables throwing street venders, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modding</strong>:\u00a0 Want to add your own word phrases, levels, and art?\u00a0 <i>Keys of Fury</i> was designed to be easily moddable!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/ed6b2e88e9cdbf69b41a1a77de7e5943.poster.avif?t=1753562262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/ed6b2e88e9cdbf69b41a1a77de7e5943.webm?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Controller</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Pure Keyboard</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Keys of Fury</i> is a retro style <i>Beat `em up</i> typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy loads of enemies as you type your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn coins for each perfect word typed and use them to purchase abilities, outfits, accessories, and music tracks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.poster.avif?t=1753562262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.webm?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546690/extras/a8f32db9940249c87800b0eb22ba281e.mp4?t=1753562262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade</strong>:\u00a0 A Potpourri of a variety of levels including Bad Dad Jokes, Racing Dinosaurs, and battling through waves of increasingly difficultly worded enemies.\u00a0 Choose upgrades between each wave to prepare for the next one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong>:\u00a0 Help clear corruption from the inner city and engage in your own witty banter with the locals.\u00a0 Fight a variety of enemies: robots, ninjas, vegetables throwing street venders, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modding</strong>:\u00a0 Want to add your own word phrases, levels, and art?\u00a0 <i>Keys of Fury</i> was designed to be easily moddable!</p></li></ul>",
